"Usage: zenoh_subscriber [OPTIONS]\n\nOptions:\n      --workload-plan <WORKLOAD_PLAN>\n          Controller-provisioned bounded sustained workload for the classic endpoint\n  -e, --endpoint <ENDPOINT>\n          The endpoint for Zenoh client to connect to [default: tcp/127.0.0.1:7447]\n      --zenoh-config <ZENOH_CONFIG>\n          Optional Zenoh JSON5 configuration file. When set, this overrides --endpoint\n      --uauthority <UAUTHORITY>\n          Authority for the local subscriber identity [default: authority-b]\n      --uentity <UENTITY>\n          UEntity ID for local subscriber identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x5BB0]\n      --uversion <UVERSION>\n          UEntity major version for local subscriber identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x1]\n      --resource <RESOURCE>\n          Resource ID for local subscriber identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x0]\n      --source-authority <SOURCE_AUTHORITY>\n          Source authority filter for publish subscription [default: authority-a]\n      --source-uentity <SOURCE_UENTITY>\n          Source UEntity ID filter for publish subscription (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x5BA0]\n      --source-uversion <SOURCE_UVERSION>\n          Source UEntity major version filter for publish subscription (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x1]\n      --source-resource <SOURCE_RESOURCE>\n          Source resource ID filter for publish subscription (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x8001]\n      --route-family <ROUTE_FAMILY>\n          Optional selected-wire route family. Omit this flag to use the classic UTransport example path [possible values: owned-frame, copy-minimized]\n      --encoding <ENCODING>\n          Payload encoding used when --route-family selects a selected-wire path [default: protobuf] [possible values: native, protobuf, xcdrv2, arrow, omgidl]\n      --timeout-ms <TIMEOUT_MS>\n          Timeout for selected-wire receive examples [default: 5000]\n  -h, --help\n          Print help\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n"
